# TEWW Redesign Spec — "Sight Beyond Sight" (v3)

Complete visual redesign of the public website (teww.org). Full creative
authority: palette, type, layout, motifs all change. **Data is sacred:** every
CMS field renders exactly as before (`getContent()`, field names,
`visibleSorted`, SEO overrides, JsonLd, RichText/HtmlContent contracts), the
three-theme system and A/A+/A++ text sizing keep working, VoiceAssistant and
AudioTour keep working, `/ad-min` is untouched.

## 1. Concept

The organization is named for the eye that does not need light. The founder
spent eight months blind in a shelter in Kabul; the work that followed turns
sound, touch, and voice into sight. The redesign makes that the visual story:

**Night-first.** The default theme is a deep indigo night; the brand color is
saffron-gold light — the third eye opening, dawn breaking. Light theme
("Day") and high-contrast remain, one tap away, first-class.

Motifs (use sparingly, one per viewport):
- **Echo ripples** — thin concentric arcs radiating from a point (sound made
  visible). Decorative SVG, aria-hidden.
- **Braille texture** — six-dot braille cells as a quiet dot-grid pattern
  (authentic: real braille spelling "TEWW" / "insight", not random dots).
- **The gold hairline** — 1px gold rules structure sections on the night bg.

